Below is the implementation of the Ruby on Rails project based on the provided OpenAPI schema. The app will provide a `/compile` endpoint that accepts a POST request with a JSON payload containing `fileName` and `fileContent`. It will attempt to compile the provided code snippet using either TypeScript or C++ compilers and return the compilation result.

